अनन्त देवेश जगन्निवास
त्वमक्षरं सदसत्तत्परं यत् ॥ ३७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3332,\"bb\":2935,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/37/b2935/\",\"body_value\":\"kasmāc ca te na nameran mahātman
garīyase brahmaṇo ’py ādi-kartre
